{"id":"wb-3-151","name":"崇兴寺双塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"崇兴寺双塔","text":"崇兴寺双塔位于中国辽宁省北镇市市区（广宁城）内东北隅，1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n据双塔的建筑风格考证，应为辽代晚期所建。塔后有明清所建的崇兴寺，双塔因而得名。双塔东西相距43米，均为八角十三级实心密檐式砖塔，东塔高44.46米，西塔高42.63米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B4%87%E5%85%B4%E5%AF%BA%E5%8F%8C%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85871966,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85871966","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4185ba51bf2272af29d8ab31.jpg","title":"The_West_Pagoda_of_Chongxing_Temple_02_2015-09.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_West_Pagoda_of_Chongxing_Temple_02_2015-09.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/The_West_Pagoda_of_Chongxing_Temple_02_2015-09.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​北镇崇兴寺双塔，西塔东面。","width":320,"height":482}}